-            <tr><td>Isolate <code>Observation</code></td><td>Organism identity</td><td>Coded organism and <code>hasMember</code> susceptibility panel</td></tr>
-            <tr><td>AST <code>Observation</code></td><td>Atomic susceptibility</td><td>Antibiotic code, raw quantity/comparator, method, interpretation, specimen, provenance</td></tr>
-          </tbody>
-        </table>
-      </div>
-      <p class="gr-source-note text-small">HL7 R4 explicitly supports a DiagnosticReport containing nested culture, isolate, and susceptibility Observations; the current HL7 Europe example uses <code>Observation.hasMember</code> for this relationship.</p>
-    </div>
